       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-CAJAL-INDUCTIVE-PROOF-STRATEGY.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-INDUCTIVE-PROOF-STATE.
           05  WS-RECURRENCE-FIXPOINT-MET  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-ADJOINT-BIJECTIVE-PRESRV PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-CHIN-MONOPOLE-SCALED     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-BERNSTEIN-SATURATED      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-INDUCTIVE-PROOF    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-VERIFY-FIXPOINT-RECURRENCE.
           PERFORM 2000-VERIFY-ADJOINT-BIJECTIVE.
           PERFORM 3000-VERIFY-CHIN-MONOPOLE.
           PERFORM 4000-SYNTHESIZE-PROOF.
           GOBACK.
       1000-VERIFY-FIXPOINT-RECURRENCE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-RECURRENCE-FIXPOINT-MET.
       2000-VERIFY-ADJOINT-BIJECTIVE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ADJOINT-BIJECTIVE-PRESRV.
       3000-VERIFY-CHIN-MONOPOLE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-CHIN-MONOPOLE-SCALED.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-BERNSTEIN-SATURATED.
       4000-SYNTHESIZE-PROOF.
           IF WS-RECURRENCE-FIXPOINT-MET = 1 AND
              WS-ADJOINT-BIJECTIVE-PRESRV = 1 AND
              WS-CHIN-MONOPOLE-SCALED = 1 AND
              WS-BERNSTEIN-SATURATED = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-INDUCTIVE-PROOF
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-INDUCTIVE-PROOF.
